		dcterms:description "This is an Conservation Unit acronym used to describe the species of salmon for which the escapement estimate is for, eg:  CK - Chinook Salmon CM - Chum Salmon CO - Coho Salmon PKE - Even Year Pink Salmon PKO - Odd Year Pink Salmon SEL - Lake Type Sockeye Salmon SER - River or Ocean Type Sockeye Salmon" ;
